          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi piŵawujile ku Sikilagi, ŵasapwile yine mwa yinduyo ni kwatumicisya acimjakwe ŵakulongolela ŵa ku Yuda, ni mtenga wakuti, “Apocele mitukajo jitusapwile pa yindu yitwasumwile kwa amagongo ŵa Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵayitumisye kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Beteli, kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Lama kum'mwela kwa Yuda, ni kwa ŵandu ŵa ku misinda ja Yatili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloele, Sifumoti, Eshitemowa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵandu ŵa ku Lakali ŵa ku misinda ja liŵele lya Yelamele, ŵa ku misinda ja liŵele lya Akeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
